        "jp": "ああ。\r\nダムチョは、わしの子供の頃のあだ名じゃ。",
        "official_en": "...Yes. Back when I was a wee little rascal, that’s what they called me.",
        "real_en": "Yes. Damcho was my nickname when I was a child."
