      "text": {
        "jp": "ああ。いいとも。\r\nと、いいたいところじゃが、わしはもう歳じゃ。\r\n一緒には遊べんよ。",
        "official_en": "I’d love to, but these wobbly old legs aren’t what they used to be. I’m afraid I’ll need to pass.",
        "real_en": "I'd love to say yes, but I'm old now. I can't play with you anymore."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
