      "text": {
        "jp": "ああ。そうじゃよ。\r\nよくわかったのう。こんなじいさんになってしまったのに。",
        "official_en": "The one and only! I’m surprised you recognized me through all these wrinkles.",
        "real_en": "That's right. I'm impressed you recognized me, even though I've become such an old man."
